{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Allow built-in previews to omit non-JSON serialized payloads.** `originalValue` is null when raw callback/invoke `errorData` is rebound, and that data is not guaranteed to be JSON. With `previewConfig` enabled, a valid value such as `raw-error-data` therefore throws from `buildPreviewFromJson`, replacing the workflow failure with a payload infrastructure failure. Treat unparsable serialized data as having no structured preview and add raw external-error coverage with previews enabled.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7oiBI_","finding_digest":"7e1f2bd03e9b6cccf2e023ded9e63b249493ded5c55cc092c891a3422781d5c8","finding_id":"arf_v1_pypsxub6tnwmz4xaeppntzr3es","finding_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloader::previewconfig::non-json-forwarded-error-failure","identity_key":"sdk/offload/filesystem/filesystempayloadoffloader::previewconfig::non-json-forwarded-error-failure","line":429,"observation_digest":"852573d9cd7ef79cec621a0415b751ecdaae126fffb09d73169486e5dbfd6d69","observation_id":"aro_v1_qusxhwonp33zz3dcdicbln2r5t","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/offload/filesystem/FileSystemPayloadOffloader.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T06:05:15Z","review_id":"arr_v1_yyzbqnknvmtxb2m3lrzaqpdkbd","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"1a9eeb8806701298af193a57d2ace64f6220d234","reviewer":"codex","start_line":427,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_ilrxmqoxn4dygcwk32nuwpdxij","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T06:05:15Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
